                ],
                [
                    106.0,
                    310.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "c. If the affected teacher names additional sources of information, including witnesses, those sources of information shall be consulted or interviewed prior to making a determination to issue a written reprimand.",
            "block_bbox": [
                106,
                310,
                513,
                381
            ],
            "block_id": 2,
            "block_order": 3,
            "group_id": 2,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    106.0,
                    310.0
                ],
                [
                    513.0,
                    310.0
                ],
                [
                    513.0,
                    381.0
                ],
                [
                    106.0,
                    381.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "d. If a written reprimand is being given to the teacher, it shall be issued within ten (10) duty days of the initial formal conference unless witnesses named by the teacher are unavailable. The time limits may also be extended by mutual consent.",
            "block_bbox": [
                106,
                381,
                514,
                470
            ],
            "block_id": 3,
            "block_order": 4,
            "group_id": 3,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    106.0,
                    381.0
                ],
                [
                    514.0,
                    381.0
                ],
                [
                    514.0,
                    470.0
                ],
                [
                    106.0,
                    470.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "e. A teacher may, within twenty (20) duty days after receipt of a letter of reprimand, file a statement of reaction which shall be attached to the reprimand and remain in the teacher's file as long as the letter of reprimand remains.",
            "block_bbox": [
                105,
                471,
                513,
                542
            ],
            "block_id": 4,
            "block_order": 5,
            "group_id": 4,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    105.0,
                    471.0
                ],
                [
                    513.0,
                    471.0
                ],
                [
                    513.0,
                    542.0
                ],
                [
                    105.0,
                    542.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "f. A written reprimand shall not serve as prima facie evidence of the facts alleged therein in any later hearing, where a suspension or dismissal of the teacher is recommended.",
            "block_bbox": [
                106,
                542,
                514,
                596
            ],
            "block_id": 5,
            "block_order": 6,
            "group_id": 5,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    106.0,
